Third-party components

Several effect stages are hand-ported from public reference implementations.
Each ported source file carries the original copyright and license notice in
its own header, and those notices must be retained in any redistribution:

  - fsr.cpp, cas.cpp
    AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1 (ffx_fsr1.h) and Contrast Adaptive
    Sharpening (ffx_cas.h).
    Copyright (c) Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. MIT License.
    https://github.com/GPUOpen-Effects/FidelityFX-CAS

  - nis_effect.cpp
    NVIDIA Image Scaling (NVScaler / NVSharpen).
    Copyright (c) NVIDIA Corporation. MIT License.
    https://github.com/NVIDIAGameWorks/NVIDIAImageScaling

  - smaa.cpp
    SMAA (Subpixel Morphological Antialiasing) reference implementation.
    Copyright (c) Jorge Jimenez, Jose I. Echevarria, Belen Masia,
    Fernando Navarro, Diego Gutierrez. MIT License.
    https://github.com/iryoku/smaa

All of the above are MIT licensed and therefore compatible with the terms of
this project's own license.
